{"id":"npc:Frost","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"阿戈尔人，塞壬唱片旗下重金属乐队“日落即逝（AUS）”的键盘手，寡言少语，似乎更擅长用音乐进行表述。似乎知道一些关于阿戈尔的事情。曾在阿卡胡拉地区驻留并开了两个月的演唱会，吸引了当地大量原住民前来观赏。在格兰法洛期间操控洋流使得流明的船只成功找到深海猎人和艾丽妮、避免了被海嗣卷入大海迷失的命运。向凯尔希承诺必要时将会代替大海给予帮助。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情OF-ST6 邂逅潮声、RI-EX-1 声东击西、SN-ST-1 古井等。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_npc_2003_Frost_1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/3/36/Avg_npc_2003_Frost_1.png/240px-Avg_npc_2003_Frost_1.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/16/Avg_npc_2003_Frost_rock.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/1/16/Avg_npc_2003_Frost_rock.png/240px-Avg_npc_2003_Frost_rock.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act11d7/level_act11d7_st01","lineCount":1,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":112,"line":113,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（拨弦）"}]},{"story":"activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end","lineCount":13,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":15,"line":16,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（solo）"},{"commandIndex":267,"line":268,"speaker":"Frost","text":"这些生命在渴望音乐！渴望力量！渴望……"},{"commandIndex":402,"line":403,"speaker":"Frost","text":"他们理解了我们的音乐，他们是最棒的听众。"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st01","lineCount":7,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":110,"line":111,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（轻盈的独奏）"},{"commandIndex":145,"line":146,"speaker":"Frost","text":"旅店，在哪儿？"},{"commandIndex":403,"line":404,"speaker":"Frost","text":"既是海洋的灯塔，也是这座城镇的灯塔……双关。"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st03","lineCount":10,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":412,"line":413,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（一段平稳的独奏）"},{"commandIndex":443,"line":444,"speaker":"Frost","text":"唱吧，你会遇见你的过去。你迟早要面对你的命运，或是让命运找上你。"},{"commandIndex":444,"line":445,"speaker":"Frost","text":"我离开海洋之后，就一直如此。"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st04","lineCount":2,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":178,"line":179,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（表示赞同的独奏）"},{"commandIndex":189,"line":190,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（疑问的独奏）"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_05_beg","lineCount":8,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":11,"line":12,"speaker":"Frost","text":"……"},{"commandIndex":41,"line":42,"speaker":"Frost","text":"……好吧。（激昂的独奏）"},{"commandIndex":42,"line":43,"speaker":"Frost","text":"我出发了。"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_06_beg","lineCount":10,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":198,"line":199,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（独奏）"},{"commandIndex":215,"line":216,"speaker":"Frost","text":"不好意思，Dan想借用那座礼拜堂。她们都在那里思考新的曲子。"},{"commandIndex":235,"line":236,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（尝试性的独奏）"}]},{"story":"activities/act17side/level_act17side_st12","lineCount":9,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":459,"line":460,"speaker":"Frost","text":"没什么，只是体能训练。能改变浪尖方向的，不只是那些不听话的坏孩子。"},{"commandIndex":473,"line":474,"speaker":"Frost","text":"我们已经来了，我们总不能白来一趟。等你做好准备，我们随时可以醒来。"},{"commandIndex":479,"line":480,"speaker":"Frost","text":"（表别离的独奏）"}]}]}